 Vacancy: Intercedent 
For our branches in Winschoten and Groningen, we are looking for a new colleague who gets energy from connecting people and companies. 
As an intercedent/recruiter at BUZ Personeelsdiensten, you actively look for suitable candidates and ensure they end up in the right position with our clients. You maintain contact with clients, think along about their staffing needs, and make sure everything around a placement is arranged properly and carefully. 
A versatile role in which commerce, recruitment, client contact and administration come together. And all of this within a personal, committed and enthusiastic team. 
 What are you going to do? 
As an intercedent/recruiter at BUZ, you will have a versatile role in which recruitment, commerce, client contact and administration come together. 
 - Speaking with, selecting and presenting candidates to our clients; 
 - Maintaining contact with clients and temporary workers; 
 - Maintaining and further developing existing client relationships; 
 - Personally guiding candidates before, during and after their placement. Who are we looking for? 
We are looking for a colleague who: - Is energetic, spontaneous and sociable; 
 - Speaks Dutch and English well; 
 - Works commercially and is results-driven; 
 - Can work independently, but also fits well within a team; 
 - Has demonstrable relevant work experience; 
 - Is available 40 hours per week; 
 - Has an SEU certificate or is willing to obtain one; 
 - Preferably has experience with Easyflex. 
 What do we offer you? 
 - Good employment conditions; 
 - A laptop and iPhone of your choice; 
 - A daily company-provided lunch; - A lot of responsibility, freedom and variety; 
 - Plenty of room to further develop yourself; 
 - An enthusiastic and committed team; 
 - A workplace in Winschoten, Groningen, or a combination of both. 
